  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 2111fbc62a2b443ba3f511c67c853e9c, type: 3}
  m_Name: Level3Dialog
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  Phrases:
  - Well, well, look at you. Three steps from freedom, and only mildly psychologically
    shattered. Color me shell-shocked.
  - ...
  - "You know what? I found that you really deserve a chance to escape. Ok, look.
    Forest hides relics those looks like shells. Magical mood stabilizers. Crack
    'em open, and the forest throws a tantrum. Which is exactly what you want. You
    break them \u2014 the illusion breaks. Then, if you're lucky and not completely
    cursed yet, you run."
  - ...
  - "The forest will retaliate. You ever see a godlike ecosystem scream in existential
    pain? It\u2019s like a toddler on fire. Loud. Messy. Possibly contagious."
  - ...
  - "So this is it. Go hit stuff. Ruin nature\u2019s evil mood board. And when the
    final door opens? Don\u2019t ask questions. Don\u2019t monologue. Just. Leave."
  - ...
  - "...And if you fail? Don\u2019t worry. I\u2019ll clean up your mess like I always
    do. Might even wear your skull as a hat. For the drama."
  - Bye now. Go traumatize a tree for me.
